2025-05-25 11:58:17,674 - agentpress - INFO - response_processor.py:1070 - Tool execution complete: scrape_webpage -> ToolResult(success=True, output='[\n  {\n    "Title": "LLM by Tooling \\u2014 Leveraging N8N and MCP for No-Code AI-Powered Automation | by MB20261 | Apr, 2025 | Medium",\n    "URL": "https://medium.com/@mb20261/llm-by-tooling-leveraging-n8n-and-mcp-for-no-code-ai-powered-automation-e3af42006ac9",\n    "Text": "[Sitemap](https://medium.com/sitemap/sitemap.xml)\\n\\n[Open in app](https://rsci.app.link/?%24canonical_url=https%3A%2F%2Fmedium.com%2Fp%2Fe3af42006ac9&%7Efeature=LoOpenInAppButton&%7Echannel=ShowPostUnderUser&source=post_page---top_nav_layout_nav-----------------------------------------)\\n\\nSign up\\n\\n[Sign in](https://medium.com/m/signin?operation=login&redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fmedium.com%2F%40mb20261%2Fllm-by-tooling-leveraging-n8n-and-mcp-for-no-code-ai-powered-automation-e3af42006ac9&source=post_page---top_nav_layout_nav-----------------------global_nav------------------)\\n\\n[Medium Logo](https://medium.com/?source=post_page---top_nav_layout_nav-----------------------------------------)\\n\\n[Write](https://medium.com/m/signin?operation=register&redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fmedium.com%2Fnew-story&source=---top_nav_layout_nav-----------------------new_post_topnav------------------)\\n\\nSign up\\n\\n[Sign in](https://medium.com/m/signin?operation=login&redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fmedium.com%2F%40mb20261%2Fllm-by-tooling-leveraging-n8n-and-mcp-for-no-code-ai-powered-automation-e3af42006ac9&source=post_page---top_nav_layout_nav-----------------------global_nav------------------)\\n\\n![](https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fill:64:64/1*dmbNkD5D-u45r44go_cf0g.png)\\n\\nMember-only story\\n\\n# LLM by Tooling \\u2014 Leveraging N8N and MCP for No-Code AI-Powered Automation\\n\\n[![MB20261](https://miro.medium.com/v2/da:true/resize:fill:64:64/0*PHvR_7SPpq77m397)](https://medium.com/@mb20261?source=post_page---byline--e3af42006ac9---------------------------------------)\\n\\n[MB20261](https://medium.com/@mb20261?source=post_page---byline--e3af42006ac9---------------------------------------)\\n\\nFollow\\n\\n7 min read\\n\\n\\u00b7\\n\\nApr 2, 2025\\n\\n[Listen](https://medium.com/m/signin?actionUrl=https%3A%2F%2Fmedium.com%2Fplans%3Fdimension%3Dpost_audio_button%26postId%3De3af42006ac9&operation=register&redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fmedium.com%2F%40mb20261%2Fllm-by-tooling-leveraging-n8n-and-mcp-for-no-code-ai-powered-automation-e3af42006ac9&source=---header_actions--e3af42006ac9---------------------post_audio_button------------------)\\n\\nShare\\n\\nIn an era where artificial intelligence is reshaping industries, the rise of no-code platforms has opened doors for both technical and non-technical users to harness AI\\u2019s potential without writing a single line of code. Among these platforms, N8N stands out as a powerful, open-source workflow automation tool, celebrated for its drag-and-drop simplicity and native AI capabilities. When paired with the Model Context Protocol (MCP), an open standard that connects AI models to external tools and data sources, N8N transforms into a versatile powerhouse capable of automating complex tasks \\u2014 from fetching real-time news to managing business workflows. This article explores how N8N and MCP work together, offering a glimpse into their features, integration potential, and practical applications. Whether you\\u2019re a developer seeking efficiency or a business owner aiming to streamline operations, this duo promises to save time, boost productivity, and democratize AI automation.\\n\\n![](https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:700/1*wjQ73p_5eVLpk6KpTwm7Dw.png)\\n\\n# Section 1: Introduction to N8N and Its AI Capabilities\\n\\nN8N is an open-source, no-code platform designed to automate workflows with ease, making it a favorite among developers, entrepreneurs, and hobbyists alike. Launched with a fair-code license, it boasts over 73.7k GitHub stars and a community of\\u2026\\n\\n## Create an account to read\\u00a0the\\u00a0full\\u00a0story.\\n\\nThe\\u00a0author made this story available to\\u00a0Medium\\u00a0members\\u00a0only.\\n\\nIf you\\u2019re new to Medium, create a new account to read this story on us.\\n\\n[Continue in app](https://rsci.app.link/?%24canonical_url=https%3A%2F%2Fmedium.com%2Fp%2Fe3af42006ac9&%7Efeature=LoOpenInAppButton&%7Echannel=ShowPostUnderUser&%7Estage=regwall&source=-----e3af42006ac9---------------------post_regwall------------------)\\n\\nOr, continue in mobile web\\n\\n[Sign up with Google](https://medium.com/m/connect/google?state=google-%7Chttps%3A%2F%2Fmedium.com%2F%40mb20261%2Fllm-by-tooling-leveraging-n8n-and-mcp-for-no-code-ai-powered-automation-e3af42006ac9%3Fsource%3D-----e3af42006ac9---------------------post_regwall------------------%26skipOnboarding%3D1%7Cregister&source=-----e3af42006ac9---------------------post_regwall------------------)\\n\\n[Sign up with Facebook](https://medium.com/m/connect/facebook?state=facebook-%7Chttps%3A%2F%2Fmedium.com%2F%40mb20261%2Fllm-by-tooling-leveraging-n8n-and-mcp-for-no-code-ai-powered-automation-e3af42006ac9%3Fsource%3D-----e3af42006ac9---------------------post_regwall------------------%26skipOnboarding%3D1%7Cregister&source=-----e3af42006ac9---------------------post_regwall------------------)\\n\\nSign up with email\\n\\nAlready have an account? [Sign\\u00a0in](https://medium.com/m/signin?operation=login&redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fmedium.com%2F%40mb20261%2Fllm-by-tooling-leveraging-n8n-and-mcp-for-no-code-ai-powered-automation-e3af42006ac9&source=-----e3af42006ac9---------------------post_regwall------------------)\\n\\n[![MB20261](https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fill:96:96/0*PHvR_7SPpq77m397)](https://medium.com/@mb20261?source=post_page---post_author_info--e3af42006ac9---------------------------------------)\\n\\n[![MB20261](https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fill:128:128/0*PHvR_7SPpq77m397)](https://medium.com/@mb20261?source=post_page---post_author_info