I can invoke\\n\\u2022 Resources: AI\\u53ef\\u8bbf\\u95ee\\u7684\\u6570\\u636e\\u6e90 Data sources AI can access\\n\\u2022 Prompts: \\u9884\\u5b9a\\u4e49\\u7684\\u63d0\\u793a\\u6a21\\u677f Pre-defined prompt templates\\"\\"\\"\\n\\nprint(\\"Slide 4 created\\")\\n\\n# Slide 5: n8n + MCP Architecture\\nslide_layout = new_ppt.slide_layouts[2]  # Object layout\\nslide = new_ppt.slides.add_slide(slide_layout)\\n\\ntitle = slide.shapes.title\\ntitle.text = \\"n8n + MCP \\u67b6\\u6784 Architecture\\"\\n\\ncontent_placeholder = slide.placeholders[1]\\ncontent_placeholder.text = \\"\\"\\"\\u7cfb\\u7edf\\u67b6\\u6784 System Architecture:\\n\\nAI\\u667a\\u80fd\\u4f53\\u5c42 AI Agent Layer:\\n\\u2022 Claude, GPT, \\u81ea\\u5b9a\\u4e49LLM Custom LLMs\\n\\u2022 \\u51b3\\u7b56\\u548c\\u54cd\\u5e94\\u751f\\u6210 Decision making and response generation\\n\\nMCP\\u534f\\u8bae\\u5c42 MCP Protocol Layer:\\n\\u2022 \\u6807\\u51c6\\u5316\\u901a\\u4fe1 Standardized communication\\n\\u2022 \\u8ba4\\u8bc1\\u548c\\u6388\\u6743 Authentication and authorization\\n\\u2022 \\u6d88\\u606f\\u8def\\u7531 Message routing\\n\\nn8n\\u5de5\\u4f5c\\u6d41\\u5f15\\u64ce n8n Workflow Engine:\\n\\u2022 \\u4e1a\\u52a1\\u903b\\u8f91\\u6267\\u884c Business logic execution\\n\\u2022 \\u5916\\u90e8\\u670d\\u52a1\\u96c6\\u6210 External service integration\\n\\u2022 \\u6570\\u636e\\u8f6c\\u6362\\u5904\\u7406 Data transformation\\n\\n\\u5916\\u90e8\\u670d\\u52a1\\u5c42 External Services Layer:\\n\\u2022 API, \\u6570\\u636e\\u5e93, \\u5de5\\u5177 APIs, Databases, Tools\\n\\u2022 \\u6587\\u4ef6, \\u6570\\u636e\\u6d41 Files, Data streams\\"\\"\\"\\n\\nprint(\\"Slide 5 created\\")\\n\\n# Slide 6: Integration Methods\\nslide_layout = new_ppt.slide_layouts[1]  # Two objects layout\\nslide = new_ppt.slides.add_slide(slide_layout)\\n\\ntitle = slide.shapes.title\\ntitle.text = \\"\\u96c6\\u6210\\u65b9\\u6cd5 Integration Methods\\"\\n\\nleft_placeholder = slide.placeholders[1]\\nleft_placeholder.text = \\"\\"\\"n8n\\u4f5c\\u4e3aMCP\\u670d\\u52a1\\u5668\\nn8n as MCP Server:\\n\\n\\u2022 \\u5c06n8n\\u5de5\\u4f5c\\u6d41\\u66b4\\u9732\\u7ed9AI\\u667a\\u80fd\\u4f53\\n  Expose n8n workflows to AI agents\\n\\n\\u2022 AI\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u89e6\\u53d1\\u548c\\u63a7\\u5236\\u5de5\\u4f5c\\u6d41\\n  AI can trigger and control workflows\\n\\n\\u2022 \\u63d0\\u4f9b\\u8ba1\\u7b97\\u3001\\u67e5\\u8be2\\u3001\\u5904\\u7406\\u80fd\\u529b\\n  Provide calculation, query, processing\\n\\n\\u2022 \\u5b9e\\u73b0\\u590d\\u6742\\u4e1a\\u52a1\\u903b\\u8f91\\u81ea\\u52a8\\u5316\\n  Automate complex business logic\\n\\n\\u5e94\\u7528\\u573a\\u666f Use Cases:\\n\\u2022 \\u6570\\u636e\\u5904\\u7406\\u670d\\u52a1 Data processing\\n\\u2022 \\u4e1a\\u52a1\\u6d41\\u7a0b\\u81ea\\u52a8\\u5316 Business automation\\n\\u2022 \\u7cfb\\u7edf\\u96c6\\u6210 System integration\\"\\"\\"\\n\\nright_placeholder = slide.placeholders[2]\\nright_placeholder.text = \\"\\"\\"n8n\\u4f5c\\u4e3aMCP\\u5ba2\\u6237\\u7aef\\nn8n as MCP Client:\\n\\n\\u2022 \\u8fde\\u63a5\\u5916\\u90e8MCP\\u670d\\u52a1\\u5668\\n  Connect to external MCP servers\\n\\n\\u2022 \\u8bbf\\u95eeAI\\u5de5\\u5177\\u548c\\u670d\\u52a1\\n  Access AI tools and services\\n\\n\\u2022 \\u6807\\u51c6\\u5316\\u7684MCP\\u8fde\\u63a5\\n  Standardized MCP connections\\n\\n\\u2022 \\u6269\\u5c55\\u5de5\\u4f5c\\u6d41\\u80fd\\u529b\\n  Extend workflow capabilities\\n\\n\\u5e94\\u7528\\u573a\\u666f Use Cases:\\n\\u2022 AI\\u670d\\u52a1\\u8c03\\u7528 AI service calls\\n\\u2022 \\u5916\\u90e8\\u5de5\\u5177\\u96c6\\u6210 External tool integration\\n\\u2022 \\u6570\\u636e\\u6e90\\u8bbf\\u95ee Data source access\\"\\"\\"\\n\\nprint(\\"Slide 6 created\\")\\n\\n# Save the presentation\\nnew_ppt.save(\'lesson5_n8n_mcp_english.pptx\')\\nprint(\\"English PPT saved successfully!\\")\\n\\nprint(\\"PPT creation completed!\\")\\nEOF\\n</execute-command>", "tool_calls": null}', 'metadata': '{"thread_run_id": "9fe0b522-322b-433a-a21b-7d8d54ab6070", "stream_status": "complete"}', 'created_at': '2025-05