2025-05-25 12:26:41,647 - agentpress - DEBUG - response_processor.py:1011 - Created tool call: {'function_name': 'execute_command', 'xml_tag_name': 'execute-command', 'arguments': {'command': 'python3 -c "\nfrom pptx import Presentation\nfrom pptx.util import Inches, Pt\nfrom pptx.dml.color import RGBColor\nfrom pptx.enum.text import PP_ALIGN\n\nprint(\'Creating customized PPT using template...\')\n\ntry:\n    # Load the template\n    ppt = Presentation(\'DrPangTemplate.pptx\')\n    print(f\'Template loaded with {len(ppt.slides)} slides\')\n    \n    # Clear existing slides except first one and keep the template structure\n    slides_to_remove = list(range(1, len(ppt.slides)))\n    for i in reversed(slides_to_remove):\n        rId = ppt.slides._sldIdLst[i].rId\n        ppt.part.drop_rel(rId)\n        del ppt.slides._sldIdLst[i]\n    \n    # Update title slide\n    title_slide = ppt.slides[0]\n    for shape in title_slide.shapes:\n        if hasattr(shape, \'text\'):\n            if \'第4讲\' in shape.text or \'最强大的几个编程智能体\' in shape.text:\n                shape.text = \'第5讲：零代码用n8n和MCP建立全自动的智能体\\\\n零代码智能自动化实现方案\'\n            elif \'DR. PANG\' in shape.text:\n                shape.text = \'DR. PANG 庞博士\\\\nAI智能体课程系列\'\n    \n    print(\'Title slide updated\')\n    \n    # Add new slides using template layouts\n    \n    # Slide 2: Course Overview (using TWO_OBJECTS layout)\n    slide_layout = ppt.slide_layouts[1]  # TWO_OBJECTS\n    slide = ppt.slides.add_slide(slide_layout)\n    \n    # Set title\n    if slide.shapes.title:\n        slide.shapes.title.text = \'课程概览与学习目标\'\n    \n    # Find and set content for placeholders\n    for i, placeholder in enumerate(slide.placeholders):\n        if i == 1:  # Left content\n            placeholder.text = \'\'\'本讲核心内容：\n• n8n工作流自动化平台深度解析\n• MCP模型上下文协议技术原理\n• 零代码AI智能体架构设计\n• n8n与MCP集成实战演练\n• 企业级应用案例深度分析\n• 生产环境部署最佳实践\n• 性能优化与故障排除技巧\'\'\'\n        elif i == 2:  # Right content\n            placeholder.text = \'\'\'学习收获：\n• 掌握n8n平台核心功能与高级特性\n• 深入理解MCP协议工作机制\n• 具备构建复杂AI智能体的能力\n• 实现零代码业务流程自动化\n• 掌握企业级部署和运维技能\n• 获得解决实际问题的实战经验\n• 跟上AI自动化技术发展前沿\'\'\'\n    \n    print(\'Slide 2 created\')\n    \n    # Slide 3: n8n Platform Introduction (using OBJECT layout)\n    slide_layout = ppt.slide_layouts[2]  # OBJECT\n    slide = ppt.slides.add_slide(slide_layout)\n    \n    if slide.shapes.title:\n        slide.shapes.title.text = \'n8n：革命性的工作流自动化平台\'\n    \n    for placeholder in slide.placeholders:\n        if placeholder.placeholder_format.type == 2:  # Content placeholder\n            placeholder.text = \'\'\'平台特色与优势：\n\n🚀 技术特性\n• 开源免费，社区活跃（73.7k+ GitHub星标）\n• 可视化拖拽编辑器，零编程门槛\n• 400+预构建集成，覆盖主流服务\n• AI原生架构，内置LangChain深度集成\n• 支持JavaScript/Python自定义代码\n\n🏢 企业级能力\n• 灵活部署：自托管/云端/混合部署\n• 高可用性：集群部署与负载均衡\n• 安全可靠：企业级权限管理与审计\n• 可扩展性：支持大规模并发处理\n\n💡 核心优势\n• 降低自动化门槛，人人可用\n• 快速原型开发，敏捷迭代\n• 强大的AI集成生态系统\n• 活跃的开源社区支持\'\'\'\n            break\n    \n    print(\'Slide 3 created\')\n    \n    # Slide 4: MCP Protocol (using OBJECT layout)\n    slide_layout = ppt.slide_layouts[2]  # OBJECT\n    slide = ppt.slides.add_slide(slide_layout)\n    \n    if slide.shapes.title:\n        slide.shapes.title.text = \'MCP：AI工具集成的统一标准\'\n    \n    for placeholder in slide.placeholders:\n        if placeholder.placeholder_format.type == 2:  # Content placeholder\n            placeholder.text = \'\'\'协议概述与架构：\n\n📋 基本信息\n• 发布时间：2024年11月，Anthropic主导\n• 定位：AI模型与外部工具交互的开放标准\n• 愿景：成为AI应用的"USB-C接口"\n\n🏗️ 三层架构\n• MCP Host：AI应用程序（Claude Desktop等）\n• MCP Client：通信连接器，协议转换\n• MCP Server：外部工具和服务提供者\n\n⚡ 核心能力\n• Tools：AI可调用的功能函数\n• Resources：AI可访问的数据资源\n• Prompts：优化的提示词模板\n\n🌟 技术优势\n• 标准化：统一的集成协议\n• 互操作性：跨平台工具复用\n• 可扩展性：轻松添加新功能\n• 安全性：内置认证授权机制\'\'\'\n            break\n    \n    print(\'Slide 4 created\')\n    \n    # Save the customized presentation\n    ppt.save(\'lesson5_n8n_mcp_template_based.pptx\')\n    print(\'Template-based PPT saved successfully!\')\n    \nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f\'Error with template: {e}\')\n    print(\'Template processing completed with modifications\')\n"'}}
